            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/IJ9.0000000000000027</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Intercalated degrees are commonly undertaken as part of the medical undergraduate course. In this article, we discuss the advantages and disadvantages of intercalation, along with alternatives that could be considered.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
